      "content": "that's a good start for that section. but i also have to address the other side for the memo. a lot of people argue that these big companies are actually killing competition by just buying up any startup that gets too big, and that their control over data is a huge privacy risk for everyone. how do you think those arguments hold up against the innovation points you just made?",
